Package: mixedcirc
Type: Package
Title: Mixed-Effects Models for Circadian Rhythm Analysis
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Payam",
    family = "Emami",
    email = "payam.emami@scilifelab.se",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Fits harmonic regression models for circadian and differential
    circadian analysis. Both ordinary linear models and mixed-effects models
    are supported, including repeated measurements, group-specific rhythms,
    direct joint differential-rhythm tests, observation-level weights,
    paired bisulfite-sequencing counts, bootstrap uncertainty, peak-time
    estimation, subject-specific rhythms, diagnostics, publication-oriented
    plots, tidy summaries, detrending, simulation, and exploratory multi-omics
    integration.
